Subject: [PATCH 1656/3799] soh: rename func_8008277C ->
 Interface_ClampButtonAlphas

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: clamps every non-zero HUD button alpha down to the given maximum, delegating to Interface_SetButtonAlphasFromStatus while the rising-alpha override is set.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_parameter.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/z_parameter.c | 11 ++++++-----
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_parameter.c b/soh/src/code/z_parameter.c
index 00b78dd58..4bcbc9f96 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/z_parameter.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/z_parameter.c
@@ -312,7 +312,8 @@ void Interface_SetButtonAlphasFromStatus(PlayState* play, s16 alpha) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_8008277C(PlayState* play, s16 maxAlpha, s16 alpha) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_8008277C: clamps every non-zero HUD button alpha down to the given maximum, delegating to Interface_SetButtonAlphasFromStatus while the rising-alpha override is set.
+void Interface_ClampButtonAlphas(PlayState* play, s16 maxAlpha, s16 alpha) {
     InterfaceContext* interfaceCtx = &play->interfaceCtx;
 
     if (gSaveContext.forceRisingButtonAlphas != 0) {
@@ -429,7 +430,7 @@ void func_80082850(PlayState* play, s16 maxAlpha) {
                 interfaceCtx->aAlpha = maxAlpha;
             }
 
-            func_8008277C(play, maxAlpha, alpha);
+            Interface_ClampButtonAlphas(play, maxAlpha, alpha);  // was func_8008277C [LLM:HIGH]
 
